09)------------HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(s_suppkey@0, ps_suppkey@2)], projection=[p_partkey@7, p_mfgr@8, s_name@1, s_address@2, s_nationkey@3, s_phone@4, s_acctbal@5, s_comment@6, ps_supplycost@10]
10)--------------DataSourceExec: file_groups={1 group: [[${WORK_DIR}/supplier.vortex]]}, projection=[s_suppkey, s_name, s_address, s_nationkey, s_phone, s_acctbal, s_comment], file_type=vortex
11)--------------HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(p_partkey@0, ps_partkey@0)], projection=[p_partkey@0, p_mfgr@1, ps_suppkey@3, ps_supplycost@4]
12)----------------DataSourceExec: file_groups={1 group: [[${WORK_DIR}/part.vortex]]}, projection=[p_partkey, p_mfgr], file_type=vortex, predicate: p_size@5 = 15 AND p_type@4 LIKE %BRASS
